# Scratch captures from development. Screenshots that belong to the project
# live in docs/media/ and are tracked; this only catches the ones left lying
# around at the repo root by grim.
/*.png
# ...except the marketplace preview, which the listing looks for at the root by
# this exact name. Without the exception the rule above silently swallows it and
# the listing falls back to a generic image.
!/preview.png
*.bak
